god: You have been chosen to transcend towards higher realm of knowledge...
label worship
god: Can you handle dimensions that werent meant for mortal's eyes? (Write "yes" or "no")
[text_input var="response"]
if {response} == "yes":
	god: Thats the correct decision. Mortals should know their place
	god: Retrieve the stone for me.
if {response} == "no":
	god: Then you shall perish. Your mind not longer will be yours. You will succumb towards the deepest pits of insanity. Your life its at my mercy.
	god: You still hold the same answer over my question?
	- No. I will worship you
		god: You made the right choice
	- Yes. I would rather die that be your pawn
		god: Then begone